WEBVTT

00:00:01.136 --> 00:00:12.026
tezaur serve starts the web app, a JSON API over your index, named workspaces and a same-origin proxy to the model server.

00:00:12.076 --> 00:00:18.965
By default it binds to 127.0.0.1 only. /api/health tells you it is alive.

00:00:19.015 --> 00:00:25.634
The same search as the CLI, over HTTP: build your own tools on top.

00:00:25.684 --> 00:00:34.374
Other endpoints: /api/sources, /api/audit, /api/refs, /api/coverage, /api/bib, /api/ingest and /api/mesh/*.
